Implementation note: an initial search-only build inherited C041's int16_t minimized-transition storage. Since C042 has 38583 nonrejecting states, this overflowed and caused a false symmetry-equivariance failure. The promoted checker widens transitions to int32_t and complement/swap maps to uint32_t; the exact checks above then pass. No theorem claim relies on the overflowed exploratory build.
